    what: "<code>cursor</code> is a constraint and setting for screen tracks, from the Screen Capture spec. <code>always</code> includes the pointer, <code>never</code> leaves it out, and <code>motion</code> shows it while it moves and removes it once it has been still for a while.",
    how: "<b>browser's default</b> leaves it out. The track's settings show what the browser is doing, and its capabilities which values it could do for that surface.",
